        ('NX-D05', 2, 'Genuine destination-plane empowerment', 'Synthetic established plane IDs P-origin and P-destination are distinct; the caster personally knows the actual clear receiving court. Druid15 opens the rank8 pair and snapshots Neutral Good. A matching traveler and a matching preexisting inhabitant elsewhere on P-destination both receive the proposed+2 at their own eligible rolls while the source lives. A matching creature still on P-origin gets no plane benefit. No eternal planetary alignment or population readout is asserted.', 'Conjuration8/newEmpowermentInterpretation'),
        ('NX-D06', 2, 'Endpoint prevention and atomic group', 'A real carrier/passenger group fitting the portal has five feet of actual movement available. A hidden Dimensional Anchor covers one destination footprint after valid commitment. The entire declared inseparable transaction remains at its origin with spent movement retained; no body, pack or passenger arrives halfway. Later removing the Anchor does not replay that transit for free.', 'Conjuration8/preventionAndFailure'),
