        ('NX-D08', 2, 'Real line of sight is not a remote caster', 'A genuine nonspell arrow attack follows20feet to an open mouth plus30feet from the other mouth to a visible target, consuming50feet of its actual range. Its same dealer/root and actual hit rules remain. A spell requiring a same-plane target cannot claim the far mouth as the caster\'s body merely because the view is visible.', 'Conjuration8/rangeSightAndAttacks'),
